1
00:00:00,490 --> 00:00:01,750
(Priya:)in this case, Leonard.

2
00:00:01,750 --> 00:00:04,110
(Priya:)So much for count one.
But...

3
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:06,400
There's no buts, Sheldon;
that's how the law works.

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,120
(Leonard:)Schooled!

5
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:14,460
(Priya:)As for the shower capacity
issue,

6
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,310
(Priya:)I cite addendum J.

7
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:18,810
"When Sheldon showers second,
any and all measures

8
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:21,800
(Priya:)shall be taken to ensure an
adequate supply of hot water."

9
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:24,920
I believe this supersedes
the occupancy issue.

10
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:27,990
Superseded!

11
00:00:31,530 --> 00:00:33,590
(Sheldon:)This isn't over.

12
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:38,820
No offense, but
shower sex with you

13
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:41,330
is now the second best thing
that's happened today.

14
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:47,410
(Raj:)Mmm, Greek food
on pizza night?

15
00:00:47,410 --> 00:00:50,040
(Raj:)This is the most delightfully
cruel thing we've done to Sheldon

16
00:00:50,040 --> 00:00:52,180
(Raj:)since we left that fake message
from Stephen Hawking

17
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:53,850
(Raj:)on his voice mail.

18
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:55,950
(Priya:)Seriously?

19
00:00:55,950 --> 00:01:00,020
I wish to discuss your theories
of black holes.

